<newsitem itemid="274201" id="root" date="1996-12-23" xml:lang="en">
<title>HONG KONG: PCL Enterprises posts loss in interim.</title>
<headline>PCL Enterprises posts loss in interim.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six month ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   0.8 loss  vs 0.1 gain</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	 vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  6.26 loss vs 6.89 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    2.32 loss vs 0.32 profit</p>
<p>    Turnover		     171.92    vs 116.76</p>
<p>    Company name		 PCL Enterprises Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - PCL Enterprises, formerly Win Win International Holdings Ltd, distributes textile machinery.</p>
<p>Exceptional loss represents provision loss for diminution in value of an associated company and loss in investment in securities. The company said it had changed its fiscal year end date to December 31 from March 31.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
